{"id":"r9sr6rjvj88kh9z3mqyigk57z","title":"韦伯望远镜确认首例超巨星与类太阳星合并事件，发表于《自然》","originalTitle":"Webb confirms first-of-its-kind merger of a supergiant and smaller sun-like star","summary":"Columbia大学研究团队在《自然》发表首篇完整重建超巨星与伴星合并过程的论文，揭示两星体在七圈轨道（约七年）内完成合并的机制。通过NASA韦伯望远镜47天后首次观测到爆发峰值数据，结合地面与空间多台望远镜的紫外-可见-近红外连续观测，论文首次量化了公共包层演化效率。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-webb-kind-merger-supergiant-smaller.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T23:20:05.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T02:30:16.681Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T02:30:16.681Z","category":"drug-therapy","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","Nature"],"score":53,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"e1bd72b8-2906-4440-8fef-1d5f2935127f","title":"韦伯望远镜确认首例超巨星与类太阳星合并事件"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"e1bd72b8-2906-4440-8fef-1d5f2935127f","title":"韦伯望远镜确认首例超巨星与类太阳星合并事件"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fobinii2pTh8","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}